# Unanchored, so the dev tools under dev/ are covered too. `/target` matched
# only the workspace's own, and dev/vkeyboard/target went in with 231 build
# artefacts before anyone noticed. Those embed the build path, so they leak a
# home directory name as well as being junk.
target/

# Never commit a credential. None of these belong in a file manager, and the
# list is here so an accident is caught by the tool rather than by a reader.
*.token
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
.env
.env.*
.envrc
secrets.*
*_history

# Everything a test or the rig writes. Anchored, so only the one at the top.
# Tests build their trees here and `jobs::carry_out` refuses under `cfg(test)`
# to change anything outside it, so a test that names the wrong path stops
# instead of deleting something real. `dev/rig.sh` puts the rig's HOME here
# too.
/tmp/

# Screenshots and recordings from the rig. A `grim` run from the repository
# root lands here.
*.png
*.ppm
*.gif
*.mp4
shot*.png

# Editor and OS leavings.
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
